WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.952
The angry ox lowered its head and snorted.

2
00:00:12.953 --> 00:00:17.184
"Let's run!" shouted Mandy.

3
00:00:17.185 --> 00:00:20.470
"Where?" Vinnie cried.

4
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:24.973
"What's going on?" a voice said suddenly.

5
00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:28.768
A young boy about Mandy's age appeared.

6
00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:33.972
He spoke softly to the angry ox and patted its neck.

7
00:00:33.973 --> 00:00:38.542
"Well, we . . . ," stuttered Vinnie.

8
00:00:38.543 --> 00:00:41.048
"Did you come to see Budi?

9
00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:46.622
The fastest ox in the village?" the boy asked proudly.

10
00:00:46.623 --> 00:00:50.533
He tied a ribbon around the calm ox's head.

11
00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:54.480
"What's your name?" asked Mandy.

12
00:00:54.481 --> 00:01:01.841
"I'm Wayan, and these are my oxen, Budi and Gede," he replied.

13
00:01:01.842 --> 00:01:04.029
"Who are you?"

14
00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:07.483
The children introduced themselves.

15
00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:10.703
Wayan had black hair and eyes.

16
00:01:10.704 --> 00:01:14.902
He wore a long, layered skirt but no shirt.

17
00:01:14.903 --> 00:01:17.624
"Are you here for the races?"

18
00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:22.449
Wayan asked, tying a ribbon on the other ox.

19
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.535
"Races?" asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:29.089
Just then a girl walked up.

21
00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:32.721
She stopped when she saw Vinnie and Mandy.

22
00:01:32.722 --> 00:01:38.662
"Wayan!" she exclaimed. "Here are some flowers."

23
00:01:38.663 --> 00:01:42.744
Mandy introduced herself and Vinnie to the girl.

24
00:01:42.745 --> 00:01:47.830
"I am Wayan's younger sister, Nyoman," she said.

25
00:01:47.831 --> 00:01:52.182
"Why are you decorating the oxen?" asked Vinnie.

26
00:01:52.183 --> 00:01:57.898
The two animals were now decorated with ribbons and flowers.

27
00:01:57.899 --> 00:02:02.687
"So people know who owns them," explained Nyoman.

28
00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.385
"And it makes them look handsome."

29
00:02:05.386 --> 00:02:09.881
"What kind of race is it?" asked Mandy.

30
00:02:09.882 --> 00:02:14.901
"It's a race of the fastest oxen," Nyoman said.

31
00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:17.059
"It is a tradition.

32
00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:22.002
Long ago, farmers needed to plant the rice seed quickly.

33
00:02:22.003 --> 00:02:25.407
They needed to plant several crops a year.

34
00:02:25.408 --> 00:02:29.690
So they made their oxen plow faster and faster.

35
00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:32.712
Soon it became a contest."

36
00:02:32.713 --> 00:02:36.690
Nyoman and Wayan's parents walked up.

37
00:02:36.691 --> 00:02:39.414
"Are these your friends?"

38
00:02:39.415 --> 00:02:42.952
their father asked, smiling kindly.

39
00:02:42.953 --> 00:02:48.175
"Yes. Can they come to the race with us?" asked Wayan.

40
00:02:48.176 --> 00:02:53.469
"Of course, but we must hurry," replied his father.

41
00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:57.988
Wayan and his father led the oxen down the road.

42
00:02:57.989 --> 00:03:03.303
Vinnie and Mandy followed with Nyoman and her mother.

43
00:03:03.304 --> 00:03:06.945
"Wow! What is that?"

44
00:03:06.946 --> 00:03:12.593
Mandy pointed to a hill that looked like a tall, grassy staircase.

45
00:03:12.594 --> 00:03:16.884
"Those are rice fields," explained Nyoman.

46
00:03:16.885 --> 00:03:21.383
"They look like giant steps!" Vinnie said.

47
00:03:21.384 --> 00:03:26.277
"The farmers specially shape the land like that," said Nyoman.

48
00:03:26.278 --> 00:03:29.750
"Why?" asked Vinnie.

49
00:03:29.751 --> 00:03:33.761
"It helps them send water evenly to all the fields.

50
00:03:33.762 --> 00:03:37.376
Water is very important to rice fields.

51
00:03:37.377 --> 00:03:44.478
The rice farmers must work together to keep all these fields alive," explained Nyoman.

52
00:03:44.479 --> 00:03:49.089
The children saw narrow streams of water here and there.

53
00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:52.392
Nyoman shook her head at them.

54
00:03:52.393 --> 00:03:57.993
"How can you live in Bali and not know about rice fields or the races?"

55
00:03:57.994 --> 00:04:00.933
"Bali?" cried Mandy.

56
00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:03.117
She turned to Vinnie.

57
00:04:03.118 --> 00:04:11.795
"We're in Indonesia!"
